# BEGIN_PANEL NO_CONDITION #####################################################
# CONVERT RESIDUAL FILES (BINARY TO ASCII) - RESFMT 1: Input/Output Files      #
#                                                                              #
# GENERAL FILES                                                                #
#   Show all general files  > % <                                              # SHOWGEN
#                                                                              #
# INPUT FILES                                                                  #
#   Residual file(s)        > %%%%%%%%%%%% <                                   # RESFILE
#                                                                              #
# GENERAL OUTPUT FILES                                                         #
#   Program output        > % < use RESFMT.Lnn            or  > %%%%%%%%%%%% < # SYSODEF SYSOUT
#   Error messages        > % < merged to program output  or  > %%%%%%%%%%%% < # ERRMRG SYSERR
#                                                                              #
# TITLE > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <   # TITLE
#                                                                              #
# END_PANEL ####################################################################


